#: 456R01
msgctxt "456R01"
msgid "Neptune on, you guessed it, a large ace of spades playing card."
msgstr "Neptunus på, du gissade rätt, ett stort spelkort med spader ess."

#: 456R02
msgctxt "456R02"
msgid "That Ace of Spades doesn't really match the others."
msgstr "Det där spader esset matchar inte riktigt de andra."

#: 456R03
msgctxt "456R03"
msgid "A two-button switch."
msgstr "En knapp med två lägen."

#: 456R04
msgctxt "456R04"
msgid ""
"A box of fine Cubano cigars, judging by the ace of spades on the box, I'd "
"bet they're the old baron's special blend."
msgstr ""
"En låda fina Cubano-cigarrer. Att döma av spader esset på lådan slår jag vad"
" om att det är den gamle baronens specialblandning."

#: 456R04A
msgctxt "456R04A"
msgid ""
"Judging by the ace of spades on the box, I bet they're the old baron's "
"special blend."
msgstr ""
"Att döma av spader esset på lådan slår jag vad om att det är den gamle "
"baronens specialblandning."

#: 456R04B
msgctxt "456R04B"
msgid "A box of fine Cubano cigars."
msgstr "En låda fina Cubano-cigarrer."

#: 456R05
msgctxt "456R05"
msgid ""
"I don't quite know what I'll need it for, especially being a non-smoker, but"
" one is plenty."
msgstr ""
"Jag vet inte riktigt vad jag behöver den till, särskilt som icke-rökare, men"
" en räcker gott."

#: 456R06
msgctxt "456R06"
msgid "A built-in lighter."
msgstr "En inbyggd tändare."

#: 456R07
msgctxt "456R07"
msgid "A chain with a little spade is a handle."
msgstr "En kedja med en liten spade som handtag."

#: 456R08
msgctxt "456R08"
msgid "The lighter must be out of fluid."
msgstr "Tändaren måste vara slut på bränsle."

#: 456R09
msgctxt "456R09"
msgid "A common two-button switch."
msgstr "En vanlig knapp med två lägen."

#: 456R10
msgctxt "456R10"
msgid "A vent, probably to draw off cigar smoke."
msgstr "En ventil, troligen för att leda bort cigarrök."

#: 456R11
msgctxt "456R11"
msgid "An ashtray."
msgstr "Ett askfat."

#: 456R12
msgctxt "456R12"
msgid "The ashtray is a permanent part of the smoking hunch."
msgstr "Askfatet är en fast del av rökskåpet."

#: 456R13
msgctxt "456R13"
msgid "Ripley, you don't put round balls in rectangular holes. It won't fit."
msgstr ""
"Ripley, du lägger inte runda bollar i rektangulära hål. Den passar inte."

#: 456R14
msgctxt "456R14"
msgid "The lighter is a permanent part of the smoking hatch."
msgstr "Tändaren är en fast del av rökskåpet."

#: 456R15
msgctxt "456R15"
msgid "The Barron Special Cigar Box is a permanent part of the smoking hatch."
msgstr "Baronens särskilda cigarrlåda är en fast del av rökskåpet."

#: 456R16
msgctxt "456R16"
msgid ""
"I know I don't smoke, but cigarettes certainly make you look sophisticated. "
"I wonder if they're as good for your health as the scientists claim."
msgstr ""
"Jag vet att jag inte röker, men cigaretter får en verkligen att se "
"sofistikerad ut. Jag undrar om de är så bra för hälsan som forskarna påstår."

#: 456R17
msgctxt "456R17"
msgid ""
"The old baron's private smoking hatch. The old gent certainly was a "
"secretive fellow."
msgstr ""
"Den gamle baronens privata rökskåp. Den gamle herrn var verkligen "
"hemlighetsfull."

#: 456R26
msgctxt "456R26"
msgid ""
"That Ace of Spades conceals the switch to the old Baron's smoking hatch."
msgstr "Det där spader esset döljer knappen till den gamle baronens rökskåp."

#: 456R27
msgctxt "456R27"
msgid "A round hole."
msgstr "Ett runt hål."

#: 456R28
msgctxt "456R28"
msgid "A rectangular hole."
msgstr "Ett rektangulärt hål."

#: 501R01
msgctxt "501R01"
msgid "Buenos dias, Mateo."
msgstr "Buenos días, Mateo."

#: 501R02
msgctxt "501R02"
msgid ""
"Dear Mr. Ripley, I regret to inform you that Professor Jorge Menendez was "
"killed two weeks ago in an attempted robbery. Most of his papers are missing"
" or destroyed. The perpetrator remains at large. We are all shocked, to say "
"the least, and it will take us months to reconstruct the professor's work. "
"But if I can be of assistance, please do not hesitate to contact me. Signed,"
" Rafael Campos, Assistant Professor of Archaeology, National University of "
"San Marcos, Lima."
msgstr ""
"Bäste herr Ripley, jag beklagar att behöva meddela att professor Jorge "
"Menendez dödades för två veckor sedan vid ett rånförsök. De flesta av hans "
"papper saknas eller har förstörts. Förövaren är fortfarande på fri fot. Vi "
"är alla chockade, milt sagt. Det kommer att ta månader att återskapa "
"professorns arbete. Men om jag kan vara till hjälp, tveka inte att kontakta "
"mig. Undertecknat Rafael Campos, biträdande professor i arkeologi, San "
"Marcos nationella universitet, Lima."

#: 501R02A
msgctxt "501R02A"
msgid ""
"We're all shocked to say the least and it will take us months to reconstruct"
" the professor's work. But if I can be of assistance, please do not hesitate"
" to contact me. Signed, Rafael Campos, Assistant Professor of Archaeology, "
"National University of San Marcos, Lima."
msgstr ""
"Vi är alla chockade, milt sagt. Det kommer att ta månader att återskapa "
"professorns arbete. Men om jag kan vara till hjälp, tveka inte att kontakta "
"mig. Undertecknat Rafael Campos, biträdande professor i arkeologi, San "
"Marcos nationella universitet, Lima."

#: 501R02B
msgctxt "501R02B"
msgid ""
"Dear Mr. Ripley, I regret to inform you that Professor Jorge Menendez was "
"killed two weeks ago in an attempted robbery. Most of his papers are missing"
" or destroyed. The perpetrator remains at large. We are all shocked to say "
"the least and it will take us months to reconstruct the professor's work. "
"But if I can be of assistance, please do not hesitate to contact me. Signed,"
" Rafael Campos, Assistant Professor of Archaeology, National University of "
"San Marcos, Lima. Months? I don't have months. The man Menendez mentioned in"
" his letter, the one who was following him, I wonder who he was."
msgstr ""
"Bäste herr Ripley, jag beklagar att behöva meddela att professor Jorge "
"Menendez dödades för två veckor sedan vid ett rånförsök. De flesta av hans "
"papper saknas eller har förstörts. Förövaren är fortfarande på fri fot. Vi "
"är alla chockade, milt sagt. Det kommer att ta månader att återskapa "
"professorns arbete. Men om jag kan vara till hjälp, tveka inte att kontakta "
"mig. Undertecknat Rafael Campos, biträdande professor i arkeologi, San "
"Marcos nationella universitet, Lima. Månader? Jag har inte månader. Mannen "
"som Menendez nämnde i sitt brev, han som följde efter honom, jag undrar vem "
"han var."

#: 501R03
msgctxt "501R03"
msgid ""
"Dear Mr. Ripley, I wanted to let you know that the identity of Professor "
"Menendez's killer has been uncovered. Evidence of the scene points to a "
"ne'er-do-well nephew of the professor named Emilio Menendez, a criminal with"
" a history of looting historical sites. The motive was greed. The nephew had"
" apparently broken into the professor's home in an attempt to steal papers "
"that would lead him to archaeological treasures. Unfortunately, the man "
"seems to have vanished, but police all over Latin America are on the lookout"
" for him. I can only hope that Emilio Menendez will be brought to justice "
"for his despicable crime. Signed, Rafael Campos, Assistant Professor of "
"Archaeology, National University of San Marcos, Lima."
msgstr ""
"Bäste herr Ripley, jag vill meddela att identiteten på professor Menendez "
"mördare har fastställts. Bevis på platsen pekar på professorns oduglige "
"brorson Emilio Menendez, en brottsling med en historia av plundring av "
"historiska platser. Motivet var girighet. Brorsonen hade uppenbarligen "
"brutit sig in i professorns hem för att stjäla papper som skulle leda honom "
"till arkeologiska skatter. Tyvärr verkar mannen ha försvunnit, men polisen i"
" hela Latinamerika letar efter honom. Jag kan bara hoppas att Emilio "
"Menendez ställs inför rätta för sitt avskyvärda brott. Undertecknat Rafael "
"Campos, biträdande professor i arkeologi, San Marcos nationella universitet,"
" Lima."

#: 501R03A
msgctxt "501R03A"
msgid ""
"The motive was greed. The nephew had apparently broken into the professor's "
"home in an attempt to steal papers that would lead him to archaeological "
"treasures. Unfortunately, the man seems to have vanished, but police all "
"over Latin America are on the lookout for him."
msgstr ""
"Motivet var girighet. Brorsonen hade uppenbarligen brutit sig in i "
"professorns hem för att stjäla papper som skulle leda honom till "
"arkeologiska skatter. Tyvärr verkar mannen ha försvunnit, men polisen i hela"
" Latinamerika letar efter honom."

#: 501R03B
msgctxt "501R03B"
msgid ""
"I can only hope that Emilio Menendez will be brought to justice for his "
"despicable crime. Signed, Rafael Campos, Assistant Professor of Archaeology,"
" National University of San Marcos, Lima."
msgstr ""
"Jag kan bara hoppas att Emilio Menendez ställs inför rätta för sitt "
"avskyvärda brott. Undertecknat Rafael Campos, biträdande professor i "
"arkeologi, San Marcos nationella universitet, Lima."

#: 501R03C
msgctxt "501R03C"
msgid ""
"Dear Mr. Ripley, I wanted to let you know that the identity of Professor "
"Menendez's killer has been uncovered. Evidence of the scene points to a "
"ne'er-do-well nephew of the professor named Emilio Menendez, a criminal with"
" a history of looting historical sites. The motive was greed. The nephew had"
" apparently broken into the professor's home in an attempt to steal papers "
"that would lead him to archaeological treasures. Unfortunately, the man "
"seems to have vanished, but police all over Latin America are on the lookout"
" for him. I can only hope that Emilio Menendez will be brought to justice "
"for his despicable crime. Signed, Rafael Campos, Assistant Professor of "
"Archaeology, National University of San Marcos, Lima. Justice has been "
"served, Professor Campos. Greed was literally the downfall of Emilio "
"Menendez."
msgstr ""
"Bäste herr Ripley, jag vill meddela att identiteten på professor Menendez "
"mördare har fastställts. Bevis på platsen pekar på professorns oduglige "
"brorson Emilio Menendez, en brottsling med en historia av plundring av "
"historiska platser. Motivet var girighet. Brorsonen hade uppenbarligen "
"brutit sig in i professorns hem för att stjäla papper som skulle leda honom "
"till arkeologiska skatter. Tyvärr verkar mannen ha försvunnit, men polisen i"
" hela Latinamerika letar efter honom. Jag kan bara hoppas att Emilio "
"Menendez ställs inför rätta för sitt avskyvärda brott. Undertecknat Rafael "
"Campos, biträdande professor i arkeologi, San Marcos nationella universitet,"
" Lima. Rättvisa har skipats, professor Campos. Girighet blev bokstavligen "
"Emilio Menendez fall."

#: 501R05
msgctxt "501R05"
msgid "An unusual looking clock."
msgstr "En ovanligt utseende klocka."

#: 501R05A
msgctxt "501R05A"
msgid "I wonder if there is a story behind it."
msgstr "Jag undrar om det finns en historia bakom den."

#: 501R06
msgctxt "501R06"
msgid ""
"Standard views of Lake Titicaca, El Misti, that magnificent extinct volcano "
"with the evocative name, and of course the ancient cities like Machu Picchu."
msgstr ""
"Vanliga vyer över Titicacasjön, El Misti, den magnifika utslocknade vulkanen"
" med det stämningsfulla namnet och förstås forntida städer som Machu Picchu."

#: 501R07
msgctxt "501R07"
msgid "Puffins. Stuffed, carved, molded, painted..."
msgstr "Lunnefåglar. Uppstoppade, snidade, gjutna, målade …"

#: 501R07A
msgctxt "501R07A"
msgid "A unique collection."
msgstr "En unik samling."

#: 501R08
msgctxt "501R08"
msgid "A magnificent stelae. One pictograph looks like a giant condor."
msgstr "En magnifik stele. Ett piktogram ser ut som en jättelik kondor."

#: 501R08A
msgctxt "501R08A"
msgid "It's a shame some of those blocks are broken off."
msgstr "Synd att några av de där blocken har brutits av."

#: 501R10
msgctxt "501R10"
msgid ""
"A simple brick wall atop an ancient Inca stone foundation. With stones "
"fitted so tightly, a razor blade cannot be slit between them. I'll wager the"
" Inca stones are here long after their modern counterparts have crumbled to "
"dust."
msgstr ""
"En enkel tegelvägg ovanpå en forntida inkastengrund. Stenarna är så tätt "
"sammanfogade att ett rakblad inte kan pressas in mellan dem. Jag slår vad om"
" att inkastenarna finns kvar långt efter att deras moderna motsvarigheter "
"har vittrat till damm."

#: 501R12
msgctxt "501R12"
msgid "Posh Express Man in Peru, efficient and friendly."
msgstr "Posh Express-mannen i Peru, effektiv och vänlig."

#: 501R14
msgctxt "501R14"
msgid "Did I remember to ask my landlady to water my plants?"
msgstr "Kom jag ihåg att be min hyresvärdinna vattna mina växter?"

#: 501R19
msgctxt "501R19"
msgid "The stele is far too heavy."
msgstr "Stelen är alldeles för tung."

#: 501R20
msgctxt "501R20"
msgid "What am I thinking of? I don't want to steal the puffin!"
msgstr "Vad tänker jag på? Jag vill inte stjäla lunnefågeln!"

#: 501R21
msgctxt "501R21"
msgid "I expect my tail would object if I tried to walk off with the clock."
msgstr ""
"Jag antar att min skugga skulle invända om jag försökte gå iväg med klockan."

#: 501R34
msgctxt "501R34"
msgid "I already have a sketch of the stele."
msgstr "Jag har redan en skiss av stelen."

#: 501R35
msgctxt "501R35"
msgid ""
"Other than the stelae, there is nothing else of interest to sketch in here."
msgstr "Förutom stelen finns det inget annat intressant att skissa här inne."

#: 501R36
msgctxt "501R36"
msgid "This Driftwood reminded me of a puffin when I first saw it."
msgstr ""
"Den här drivveden påminde mig om en lunnefågel när jag såg den första "
"gången."

#: 501R37
msgctxt "501R37"
msgid ""
"Your son might like it, and that circular hole your clock might fit in "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Din son kanske gillar den. Din klocka kanske passar i det runda hålet där."

#: 501R38
msgctxt "501R38"
msgid "Could we trade?"
msgstr "Kan vi byta?"

#: 501R39
msgctxt "501R39"
msgid "Don't worry about me. This piece of coral is payment enough."
msgstr "Oroa dig inte för mig. Den här korallbiten är betalning nog."

#: 501R40
msgctxt "501R40"
msgid ""
"Ripley, where do you think you're going? You don't know your way around "
"these parts. Getting lost won't help."
msgstr ""
"Ripley, vart tror du att du är på väg? Du känner inte till trakten här. Att "
"gå vilse hjälper inte."
